   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EBS311 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13936 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EBS311 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13936 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend at least 80% of contact sessions to be eligible for the final assessment.<br><br>- Complete all exercises, assignments, labs, and coding tasks assigned by the instructor both in class and at home, and submit on time.<br><br>- Use laptops and development boards strictly for learning and project purposes during class.<br><br>- Regularly access the FU FLM portal (<a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a>) for updated course materials and announcements.<br><br>- Maintain a lab notebook documenting advanced practical work, source code, debugging steps, system configurations, and learnings.<br><br>- Actively participate in hands-on labs by programming, configuring, and testing peripherals (ADC, PIT Timer, I2C, UART, SPI, CAN) on the S32K144 board.<br><br>- Form project groups (3–5 members) to design and implement an advanced automotive/industrial embedded application, integrating communication protocols and interrupt handling, and present outcomes with demo and technical report.<br><br>- Apply advanced C programming techniques, CMSIS, and RTOS task management to optimize resource usage and system performance; seek instructor feedback and iterate on improvements.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend at least 80% of contact sessions to be eligible for the final assessment.<br><br>- Complete all exercises, assignments, labs, and coding tasks assigned by the instructor both in class and at home, and submit on time.<br><br>- Use laptops and development boards strictly for learning and project purposes during class.<br><br>- Regularly access the FU FLM portal (<a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a>) for updated course materials and announcements.<br><br>- Maintain a lab notebook documenting advanced practical work, source code, debugging steps, system configurations, and learnings.<br><br>- Actively participate in hands-on labs by programming, configuring, and testing peripherals (ADC, PIT Timer, I2C, UART, SPI, CAN) on the S32K144 board.<br><br>- Form project groups (3–5 members) to design and implement an advanced automotive/industrial embedded application, integrating communication protocols and interrupt handling, and present outcomes with demo and technical report.<br><br>- Apply advanced C programming techniques, CMSIS, and RTOS task management to optimize resource usage and system performance; seek instructor feedback and iterate on improvements.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13936</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13936</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
